      "title": "In plain words",
      "items": [
        "Wall 1: the locked phone only runs Samsung-signed images",
        "Wall 2: Treble pairs a system with vendor code only when versions match exactly",
        "The locked bootloader is the wall you actually hit; the VINTF check is a second one behind it"
      ]
    },
