      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "How sure is Wall 2?",
      "items": [
        "Level 3 and levels 4 to 8 were both reproduced first-hand",
        "The refusal is what the exact-match rule says should happen",
        "It was not booted to confirm, and an Android 9-era GSI was not tested"
